# A label framed by hand goes on its cart like a sticker: it peels off the framing screen with
# a corner curled up, flies to the cart in the cart menu and is smoothed down onto it.
# The search finds the scenario's made-up label; the screens in flight are grabbed, not
# compared, as they depend on when they are caught.
press a
phase Shelf
set online 1
# The GB shelf: START on a GBA cart opens the core picker instead.
press r1
idle
press start
idle
grab menu-before
press y
idle
press start
idle
grab grid
press a
idle
grab framing
press a 40
grab peel-1
wait 120
grab peel-2
wait 120
grab peel-3
wait 120
grab peel-4
wait 120
grab peel-5
wait 120
grab peel-6
wait 120
grab peel-7
wait 120
grab peel-8
wait 120
grab peel-9
idle
grab menu-after
# Kept: B leaves the menu with the cart wearing it.
press b
phase Shelf
idle
grab shelf-after
